OL,3,AWayfair among firms fined millions for
OL,4,Amisleading sales tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FWayfair is among three firms which have
OL,7,Fbeen fined #6m in total by the
OL,8,Fcompetition watchdog for illegally
OL,9,Fusing misleading sales tactics ` with
OL,10,Fsome customers set to receive refunds.
OL,12,FThe online furniture retailer was fined
OL,13,F#4.8m for misleading customers with
OL,14,Ftime-limited offers, while online
OL,15,Felectronics seller Appliances Direct
OL,16,Fwas fined #1.2m for the same practice,
OL,17,Fthe Competition Markets Authority (CMA)
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
