OL,3,AWayfair among firms fined millions for
OL,4,Amisleading sales tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Gold's Gym has been fined
OL,7,F#48,000 by the CMA for not telling
OL,8,Fcustomers the total price of
OL,9,Fmemberships.
OL,11,FAppliances Direct and Gold's Gym have
OL,12,Fbeen ordered to refund customers a
OL,13,Ftotal of #440,000. The BBC has
OL,14,Fcontacted the three companies for
OL,15,Fcomment.
